  {
   "key": "u24559",
   "en": "A burst of white noise over all frequencies nearly deafens you. Your hardsuit's heads-up display interprets it into a series of 0s and 1s:\n\n01001000\n01000101\n01001100\n01010000 \n\nThey repeat again and again, blanketing all frequencies, until the lights on the final VI cluster flicker and die.\n\n==SPECIALIZATION CLASS ACHIEVED==",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u24560",
   "en": "The second of the three computing clusters containing the VI is offline.\n",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "Startup"
   ]
  },
